    <h2>The Cosmological World: Gods, Spirits, and the Forces That Govern Life</h2>

    <p>Igbo religion is not a set of beliefs that Igbo people hold separately from their political and social lives. It is the operating system of those lives — the framework within which governance, justice, agriculture, family, and individual identity all function.</p>

